      stage: V2S
      priority: "2"
      tests: ["cheriot_mem_sys_fpv"]
      features: []
    }
    {
      name: alert
      desc: '''The subsystem sends an alert event on `alert_tx_o` after each cause and repeats it until reset.
It sends one event for each alert test and for each ping, and none without a cause.

            | Check, and its planned assertion | Kind | Requirements |
            |---|---|---|
            | failed request alerts: `assert_Alert_FailedRequestAlerts` | forward | [REQ_TAG_10](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tag_10), [REQ_ALT_01](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_alt_01) |
            | fault input alerts: `assert_Alert_FaultInputAlerts` | forward | [REQ_TAG_10](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tag_10) |
            | fatal alert repeats: `assert_Alert_FatalAlertRepeats` | forward | [REQ_TAG_10](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tag_10) |
            | test sends an event: `assert_Alert_TestSendsAnEvent` | forward | [REQ_ALT_02](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_alt_02) |
            | ping answered: `assert_Alert_PingAnswered` | forward | [REQ_ALT_06](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_alt_06) |
            | no alert without a cause: `assert_Alert_NoAlertWithoutACause` | backward | [REQ_ALT_02](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_alt_02), [REQ_ALT_03b](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_alt_03b), [REQ_ALT_06](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_alt_06), [REQ_ALT_04](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_alt_04), [REQ_ALT_05](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_alt_05) |

