    }
    {
      name: csr
      desc: '''Every register field has its reset value, its access type and its lock, and every cause of a bus error is answered with an error: the CSR checker decides these rows.
The checks of this testpoint add what the register file hands to the engine and the request rate of the register interface.

            | Check, and its planned assertion | Kind | Requirements |
            |---|---|---|
            | locked base stable: `assert_Csr_LockedBaseStable` | forward | [REQ_TBRE_05a](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_05a) |
            | locked num stable: `assert_Csr_LockedNumStable` | forward | [REQ_TBRE_05b](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_05b) |
            | locked start no strobe: `assert_Csr_LockedStartNoStrobe` | forward | [REQ_TBRE_05c](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_05c) |
            | start strobe only unlocked: `assert_Csr_StartStrobeOnlyUnlocked` | backward | - |
            | start strobe on write: `assert_Csr_StartStrobeOnWrite` | forward | - |
            | base written: `assert_Csr_BaseWritten` | forward | [REQ_TBRE_06a](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_06a) |
            | num written: `assert_Csr_NumWritten` | forward | [REQ_TBRE_06b](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_06b) |
            | base changes only by write: `assert_Csr_BaseChangesOnlyByWrite` | backward | [REQ_TBRE_06a](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_06a) |
            | num changes only by write: `assert_Csr_NumChangesOnlyByWrite` | backward | [REQ_TBRE_06b](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_06b) |
            | intr set by set request: `assert_Csr_IntrSetBySetRequest` | backward | - |
            | intr set takes: `assert_Csr_IntrSetTakes` | forward | - |
            | intr stays set: `assert_Csr_IntrStaysSet` | forward | [REQ_TBRE_29a](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_29a) |
            | intr clear wins: `assert_Csr_IntrClearWins` | forward | [REQ_TBRE_29b](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_29b) |
            | read returns register: `assert_Csr_ReadReturnsRegister` | forward | [REQ_TBRE_06a](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_06a), [REQ_TBRE_06b](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_06b), [REQ_TBRE_06c](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_06c) |
            | request every other cycle: `assert_Csr_RequestEveryOtherCycle` | forward | [REQ_REG_02](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_reg_02) |

            The CSR checker decides these requirements, alone or with the checks above:

            * [REQ_REG_01a](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_reg_01a)
            * [REQ_REG_01b](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_reg_01b)
            * [REQ_REG_03a](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_reg_03a)
            * [REQ_REG_03b](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_reg_03b)
            * [REQ_REG_05a](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_reg_05a)
            * [REQ_REG_05b](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_reg_05b)
            * [REQ_REG_05c](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_reg_05c)
            * [REQ_REG_05d](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_reg_05d)
            * [REQ_REG_05e](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_reg_05e)
            * [REQ_REG_06](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_reg_06)
            * [REQ_REG_09](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_reg_09)
            * [REQ_ALT_03a](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_alt_03a)
            * [REQ_ALT_03c](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_alt_03c)
            * [REQ_TBRE_04b](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_04b)
            * [REQ_TBRE_05a](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_05a)
            * [REQ_TBRE_05b](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_05b)
            * [REQ_TBRE_05c](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_05c)
            * [REQ_TBRE_36b](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_36b)

            24 [requirements](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#registers-and-alert) belong to this testpoint.'''
      stage: V2
      priority: "2"
      tests: ["cheriot_mem_sys_fpv"]
      features: ["REQ_REG_01a", "REQ_REG_01b", "REQ_REG_02", "REQ_REG_03a", "REQ_REG_03b", "REQ_REG_05a", "REQ_REG_05b", "REQ_REG_05c", "REQ_REG_05d", "REQ_REG_05e", "REQ_REG_06", "REQ_REG_09", "REQ_ALT_03a", "REQ_ALT_03c", "REQ_TBRE_04b", "REQ_TBRE_05a", "REQ_TBRE_05b", "REQ_TBRE_05c", "REQ_TBRE_06a", "REQ_TBRE_06b", "REQ_TBRE_06c", "REQ_TBRE_29a", "REQ_TBRE_29b", "REQ_TBRE_36b"]
