    {
      name: tag_read_after_write
      desc: '''A hinted capability load returns the tag last written to that capability.
A write sets the capability's tag to its tag sideband and changes no other tag.

            This testpoint has no check of its own.
            The checks of other testpoints decide its requirements together.

            | Requirement | Decided by the checks of |
            |---|---|
            | [REQ_TAG_01](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tag_01) | `arb_forward`, `arb_return`, `meta_forward`, `meta_return`, `rmw_read`, `rmw_single_op`, `rmw_write_back`, `tag_isolation`, `tf_meta_request`, `tf_sticky_tag` |
            | [REQ_TAG_02](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tag_02) | `arb_forward`, `meta_forward`, `rmw_single_op`, `rmw_write_back`, `rmw_write_skip`, `tf_lookup`, `tf_meta_request` |
            | [REQ_TAG_03](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tag_03) | `arb_forward`, `meta_forward`, `rmw_single_op`, `rmw_write_back`, `rmw_write_skip`, `tf_lookup`, `tf_meta_request` |
            | [REQ_TAG_04](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tag_04) | `arb_forward`, `meta_forward`, `rmw_single_op`, `rmw_write_back`, `tag_isolation`, `tf_meta_request` |

            4 [requirements](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#end-to-end-requirements) belong to this testpoint.'''
      stage: V2
      priority: "2"
      tests: ["cheriot_mem_sys_fpv"]
      features: ["REQ_TAG_01", "REQ_TAG_02", "REQ_TAG_03", "REQ_TAG_04"]
    }
    {
      name: tag_no_deadlock
      desc: '''Every core request is answered, whatever the engine's tag filter asks of the shared RMW filter.

            This testpoint has no check of its own.
            The checks of other testpoints decide its requirements together.

            | Requirement | Decided by the checks of |
            |---|---|
            | [REQ_TAG_09](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tag_09) | `arb_flow`, `contracts`, `rmw_single_op`, `tf_flow` |

            1 [requirement](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#end-to-end-requirements) belongs to this testpoint.'''
      stage: V2
      priority: "2"
      tests: ["cheriot_mem_sys_fpv"]
      features: ["REQ_TAG_09"]
    }
    {
      name: rev_end_to_end
      desc: '''After a sweep with no `sweep_err`, a revoked capability reads back untagged.
