            This testpoint has no check of its own.
            The checks of other testpoints decide its requirements together.

            | Requirement | Decided by the checks of |
            |---|---|
            | [REQ_TBRE_38](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_38) | `arb_forward`, `meta_forward`, `rmw_write_back`, `rmw_write_skip`, `tbre_clear`, `tbre_decision`, `tbre_watch` |
            | [REQ_TBRE_39](../doc/fpv/requirements.md#req_tbre_39) | `arb_flow`, `rmw_single_op`, `tbre_watch`, `tf_forward`, `tf_lookup` |

